paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{lll}
      {A\mathbf{x}(t)} & = & {A\left\lbrack (1 - t)^{3}\mathbf{p}_{0} + 3t(1 - t)^{2}\mathbf{p}_{1} + 3t^{2}(1 - t)\mathbf{p}_{2} + t^{3}\mathbf{p}_{3} \right\rbrack} \\
       & = & {{(1 - t)}^{3}A\mathbf{p}_{0} + 3t(1 - t)^{2}A\mathbf{p}_{1} + 3t^{2}(1 - t)A\mathbf{p}_{2} + t^{3}A\mathbf{p}_{3}}
      \end{array}$$

$$\begin{array}{lll}
      {\mathbf{x}(t)} & = & {\left\lbrack \begin{array}{llll}
      \mathbf{p}_{0} & \mathbf{p}_{1} & \mathbf{p}_{2} & \mathbf{p}_{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack\left\lbrack \begin{array}{l}
      (1 - t)^{3} \\
      {3t(1 - t)^{2}} \\
      {3t^{2}(1 - t)} \\
      t^{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack} \\
       & = & {\left\lbrack \begin{array}{llll}
      \mathbf{p}_{0} & \mathbf{p}_{1} & \mathbf{p}_{2} & \mathbf{p}_{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack\left\lbrack \begin{array}{l}
      {1 - 3t + 3t^{2} - t^{3}} \\
      {3t - 6t^{2} + 3t^{3}} \\
      {3t^{2} - 3t^{3}} \\
      t^{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack} \\
       & = & {\left\lbrack \begin{array}{llll}
      \mathbf{p}_{0} & \mathbf{p}_{1} & \mathbf{p}_{2} & \mathbf{p}_{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack\left\lbrack \begin{array}{rrrr}
      1 & {- 3} & 3 & {- 1} \\
      0 & 3 & {- 6} & 3 \\
      0 & 0 & 3 & {- 3} \\
      0 & 0 & 0 & 1
      \end{array} \right\rbrack\left\lbrack \begin{array}{l}
      1 \\
      t \\
      t^{2} \\
      t^{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack}
      \end{array}$$

$$\begin{matrix}
      {\mathbf{x}(s)} & = & {\mathbf{u}{(s)}^{T}M_{B}^{T}\begin{bmatrix}
      \mathbf{p}_{0} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{1} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{2} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{3}
      \end{bmatrix} = \begin{bmatrix}
      1 & s & s^{2} & s^{3}
      \end{bmatrix}\left\lbrack \begin{array}{rrrr}
      1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\
      {- 3} & 3 & 0 & 0 \\
      3 & {- 6} & 3 & 0 \\
      {- 1} & 3 & {- 3} & 1
      \end{array} \right\rbrack\left\lbrack \begin{array}{l}
      \mathbf{p}_{0} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{1} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{2} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack} \\
       & = & {\left\lbrack {(1 - s)}^{3} 3s{(1 - s)}^{2} 3s^{2}(1 - s) s^{3} \right\rbrack\left\lbrack \begin{array}{l}
      \mathbf{p}_{0} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{1} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{2} \\
      \mathbf{p}_{3}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack}
      \end{matrix}$$

statement.paragraph:
A $\text{B-spline}$ is built out of $\text{B-spline}$ segments, described in Exercise 2. Let $\textbf{p}_{0},\ldots,\textbf{p}_{4}$ be control points. For $0 \leq t \leq 1$, let $\textbf{x}(t)$ and $\textbf{y}(t)$ be determined by the geometry matrices $\text{[}\begin{matrix}
      \mathbf{p}_{0} & \mathbf{p}_{1} & \mathbf{p}_{2} & \mathbf{p}_{3}
      \end{matrix}\text{]}$ and $\text{[}\begin{matrix}
      \mathbf{p}_{1} & \mathbf{p}_{2} & \mathbf{p}_{3} & \mathbf{p}_{4}
      \end{matrix}\text{]}$, respectively. Notice how the two segments share three control points. The two segments do not overlap, however—they join at a common endpoint, close to $\textbf{p}_{2}$.﻿

statement.math:
$$\begin{matrix}
      {\mathbf{x}(t)\, = (1 - t)^{4}\mathbf{p}_{0} + 4t(1 - t)^{3}\mathbf{p}_{1} + 6t^{2}\left( {1 - t} \right)^{2}\mathbf{p}_{2} + 4t^{3}\left( {1 - t} \right)\mathbf{p}_{3} + t^{4}\mathbf{p}_{4}} & {\text{for~~0} \leq t \leq 1}
      \end{matrix}$$
